# Personal Blog

Responsive website that lets you make blog posts

---

## Features

- **Real-time validation** Users see in real time if their input is invalid
- **Add posts** Post button allows users to add blog posts
- **Remove Posts** Remove Button allows users to remove a post
- **Edit Posts** Edit button allows users to edit a post in real time
- **Local storage data** Allows users to come back with their previous post data saved and ready to display

---

## Reflection
- Used eventlisteners to make the html page as responsive as possible
- Main challenge was understand what was being affected from editing an post and how I should implement items
- Overcame issues by using console.log constantly and repeatedly see how my postList array and postId was being affected when using different buttons
